{
  "id": "dmwaa5jwicqoo",
  "name": "右键上下文菜单",
  "tags": [
    "交互",
    "弹窗"
  ],
  "summary": "区域内右键弹出就地操作菜单：新建 / 重命名 / 复制 / 删除按组分隔、右侧带快捷键；点空白或 Esc 关闭，↑↓ 选择、Enter 执行。",
  "usage": "文件列表、画布、表格行这类「对着对象就地操作」的场景；操作 4–8 个、能按语义分组时，仅桌面端。",
  "caution": "全局搜索式操作用命令面板，别拿右键菜单当主入口；移动端没有右键，改用长按或每行的「⋯」按钮。",
  "hint": "在文件行上右键，菜单跟鼠标位置弹出 · 演示自动跑一遍",
  "prompt": "【右键上下文菜单】目标：区域内右键就地弹出操作菜单（新建 / 重命名 / 复制 / 删除按组分隔、右侧带快捷键），点空白或 Esc 关闭，↑↓ 选择、Enter 执行。\n\n1) 结构：.card（当作「应用窗口」画布，`width:100%;height:100%;max-width:340px;max-height:150px`）> 文件列表；**.menu 放在卡片外面、用 `position:fixed`**（相对视口），不要放卡片里做 absolute。\n\n2) **定位**：用 `e.clientX / e.clientY`（视口坐标）定位；`left + menuWidth > innerWidth - 6` 时翻到鼠标左侧，`top + menuHeight > innerHeight - 6` 时翻到上方；最后把 left/top clamp 进视口。\n   **别把菜单塞进卡片做 absolute 定位** —— 卡片一旦有 `overflow:hidden`（圆角裁剪），菜单超出部分会被裁掉。\n\n3) 卡片 `overflow` 必须 `visible`，让内容自己 `overflow:hidden`（.files）。\n\n4) **必须重置 focus outline**：菜单打开会 `menu.focus()`，浏览器默认画黑色焦点框。给 `.menu` 和 `.mi` 都加 `outline:0`（含 `:focus-visible`），键盘选中靠 `.sel` 背景高亮。\n\n5) **快捷键：一个键一个键帽**（重要）。组合键要拆成多个 `<kbd>`，放在 `.keys`（`inline-flex` + `gap:2px`）里，**绝不能把 `⇧⌘N` 塞进同一个 kbd** —— 那样看着像一个巨大的怪键，用户会以为是录入错误。\n   ```html\n   <span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⇧</kbd><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>N</kbd></span>\n   ```\n   kbd 样式：等宽字体、最小宽 15px、高 15px、1px 描边 + 底边 2px（立体键帽感）、4px 圆角。\n\n6) 交互：`contextmenu` 事件 `preventDefault`；点菜单外 mousedown 关闭；Esc 关闭；↑↓ 循环选择（`.sel`）；Enter 执行；菜单 `tabindex=\"-1\"` 打开后 `focus({preventScroll:true})`。\n\n7) 视觉：菜单 9px 圆角 + 1px 边框 + 大阴影；菜单项 10px 字号、2px 上下 padding；危险项 danger 色；分隔线 1px 10% 透明。\n\n8) **尺寸约束**：卡片预览高只有 176px，菜单高度压到 ~130px 以内，小视口用 `@media (max-height:420px)` 再压字号和 padding。\n\n9) 打开时 `el.animate` opacity 0→1 + translateY(-4px→0) + scale(.97→1)，140ms ease-out。\n\n10) 演示：光标移到第 3 个文件 → 右键 → 菜单弹出 → 光标移到「复制」→ 点击 → 状态栏变「已复制 xx」。弹窗里保留真实右键。\n\n11) 无障碍：menu `role=\"menu\"`、项 `role=\"menuitem\"`、分隔 `role=\"separator\"`、选中项 `aria-selected`。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:8px}\n\n/* 卡片 = 「应用窗口」画布，撑满可用区域；不要 overflow:hidden，否则菜单会被裁掉 */\n.card{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:340px;height:100%;max-height:150px;background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent);border-radius:12px;padding:9px 12px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;flex:0 0 auto}\n\n.head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.head b{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.head .status{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);transition:color .18s ease}\n.head .status.ok{color:var(--ui-success)}\n.head .status.warn{color:var(--ui-danger)}\n\n.files{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}\n.file{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:7px;cursor:default;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;transition:background .14s ease,border-color .18s ease}\n.file:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 5%,var(--ui-bg))}\n.file.pressing{opacity:.75}\n.file .ico{width:17px;height:17px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:5px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,var(--ui-bg));color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.file .ico svg{display:block;width:10px;height:10px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.file .nm{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\n.file .mt{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.file.flash{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,var(--ui-bg));border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 26%,transparent)}\n\n/* ---------- 右键菜单：fixed 到视口，可以在卡片外完整展开 ---------- */\n/* outline:0 必须给：菜单打开时会 focus()，浏览器默认会画一圈黑色焦点框 */\n.menu{position:fixed;z-index:40;min-width:140px;padding:3px;border-radius:9px;outline:0;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);box-shadow:0 12px 32px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent);display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:1px}\n.menu.open{display:flex}\n.menu:focus,.menu:focus-visible{outline:0}\n.mi{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;width:100%;padding:2px 6px;border:0;border-radius:5px;outline:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:10px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background .1s ease}\n.mi:hover,.mi.sel{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,var(--ui-bg))}\n.mi:focus-visible{outline:0}\n.mi .txt{flex:1;min-width:0;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.mi.danger{color:var(--ui-danger)}\n.mi.danger:hover,.mi.danger.sel{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 10%,var(--ui-bg))}\n/* 快捷键：每个键一个独立键帽，别把组合键塞进同一个块 */\n.keys{flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:2px}\n.mi kbd{flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:15px;height:15px;padding:0 3px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 15%,transparent);border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:4px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 5%,var(--ui-bg));color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,\"Courier New\",monospace;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1}\n.sep{height:1px;margin:1px 3px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:6px}\n  .card{padding:7px 10px 6px;gap:5px;border-radius:10px}\n  .head b{font-size:10px}\n  .head .status{font-size:9px}\n  .file{padding:3.5px 5px;gap:6px}\n  .file .ico{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:5px}\n  .file .ico svg{width:9px;height:9px}\n  .file .nm{font-size:10.5px}\n  .file .mt{font-size:8.5px}\n  .menu{min-width:132px;padding:2px}\n  .mi{font-size:9.5px;padding:1.5px 5px;gap:6px}\n  .mi kbd{height:13px;min-width:14px;padding:0 2.5px;font-size:8px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .file,.mi,.head .status{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\" id=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><b>项目文件</b><span class=\"status\" id=\"status\">3 个文件</span></div>\n  <div class=\"files\" id=\"files\">\n    <div class=\"file\" data-name=\"设计稿.fig\">\n      <span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"nm\">设计稿.fig</span><span class=\"mt\">今天</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"file\" data-name=\"需求说明.pdf\">\n      <span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"nm\">需求说明.pdf</span><span class=\"mt\">昨天</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"file\" data-name=\"报价.xlsx\">\n      <span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"nm\">报价.xlsx</span><span class=\"mt\">3 天前</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"menu\" id=\"menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"文件操作\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n  <button class=\"mi\" role=\"menuitem\" type=\"button\" data-act=\"newFile\"><span class=\"txt\">新建文件</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>N</kbd></span></button>\n  <button class=\"mi\" role=\"menuitem\" type=\"button\" data-act=\"newFolder\"><span class=\"txt\">新建文件夹</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⇧</kbd><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>N</kbd></span></button>\n  <div class=\"sep\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n  <button class=\"mi\" role=\"menuitem\" type=\"button\" data-act=\"rename\"><span class=\"txt\">重命名</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>F2</kbd></span></button>\n  <button class=\"mi\" role=\"menuitem\" type=\"button\" data-act=\"copy\"><span class=\"txt\">复制</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>C</kbd></span></button>\n  <div class=\"sep\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n  <button class=\"mi danger\" role=\"menuitem\" type=\"button\" data-act=\"del\"><span class=\"txt\">删除</span><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌦</kbd></span></button>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var card = document.getElementById('card'),\n      files = document.getElementById('files'),\n      menu = document.getElementById('menu'),\n      status = document.getElementById('status');\n\n  var isOpen = false, target = null, sel = 0, timers = [], cursor = null, statusTimer = null, timer = null;\n\n  function items(){ return [].slice.call(menu.querySelectorAll('.mi')); }\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n\n  function setStatus(text, kind){\n    status.textContent = text;\n    status.className = 'status' + (kind ? ' ' + kind : '');\n    if(statusTimer) clearTimeout(statusTimer);\n    if(kind) statusTimer = setTimeout(function(){ setStatus('3 个文件'); }, 1800);\n  }\n\n  function paintSel(){\n    items().forEach(function(it, i){\n      it.classList.toggle('sel', i === sel);\n      it.setAttribute('aria-selected', i === sel ? 'true' : 'false');\n    });\n  }\n\n  /* 用视口坐标定位（fixed），超出右/下边缘时翻转，保证菜单在任何位置都完整可见 */\n  function openMenu(vx, vy){\n    menu.classList.add('open');\n    var mw = menu.offsetWidth, mh = menu.offsetHeight;\n    var vw = window.innerWidth, vh = window.innerHeight;\n    var left = vx, top = vy;\n    if(left + mw > vw - 6) left = vx - mw;\n    if(top + mh > vh - 6) top = vy - mh;\n    left = Math.max(6, Math.min(left, vw - mw - 6));\n    top = Math.max(6, Math.min(top, vh - mh - 6));\n    menu.style.left = left + 'px';\n    menu.style.top = top + 'px';\n    isOpen = true;\n    sel = 0;\n    paintSel();\n    if(menu.animate){\n      menu.animate(\n        [{ opacity: 0, transform: 'translateY(-4px) scale(.97)' }, { opacity: 1, transform: 'none' }],\n        { duration: 140, easing: 'ease-out' }\n      );\n    }\n    try { menu.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 老浏览器忽略 */ }\n  }\n\n  function closeMenu(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = false;\n    menu.classList.remove('open');\n    target = null;\n  }\n\n  function act(kind){\n    var name = target ? target.getAttribute('data-name') : '';\n    if(kind === 'newFile'){ closeMenu(); setStatus('已新建文件'); return; }\n    if(kind === 'newFolder'){ closeMenu(); setStatus('已新建文件夹'); return; }\n    if(kind === 'del'){ closeMenu(); setStatus('已删除 ' + name, 'warn'); return; }\n    closeMenu();\n    if(target){\n      target.classList.add('flash');\n      setTimeout(function(){ if(target) target.classList.remove('flash'); }, 700);\n    }\n    setStatus((kind === 'copy' ? '已复制 ' : '已重命名 ') + name, 'ok');\n  }\n\n  files.addEventListener('contextmenu', function(e){\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var row = e.target && e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('.file') : null;\n    target = row;\n    openMenu(e.clientX, e.clientY);\n  });\n\n  files.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    var row = e.target && e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('.file') : null;\n    if(row) target = row;\n  });\n\n  menu.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    var it = e.target && e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('.mi') : null;\n    if(!it) return;\n    act(it.getAttribute('data-act'));\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('mousedown', function(e){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    if(menu.contains(e.target)) return;\n    closeMenu();\n  });\n\n  menu.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    var list = items();\n    if(e.key === 'ArrowDown'){ e.preventDefault(); sel = (sel + 1) % list.length; paintSel(); }\n    else if(e.key === 'ArrowUp'){ e.preventDefault(); sel = (sel - 1 + list.length) % list.length; paintSel(); }\n    else if(e.key === 'Enter'){ e.preventDefault(); if(list[sel]) act(list[sel].getAttribute('data-act')); }\n    else if(e.key === 'Escape'){ e.preventDefault(); closeMenu(); }\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Escape' && isOpen) closeMenu();\n  });\n\n  function reset(){\n    clearTimers();\n    closeMenu();\n    document.querySelectorAll('.file').forEach(function(f){ f.classList.remove('flash','pressing'); });\n    setStatus('3 个文件');\n  }\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    reset();\n    var rows = [].slice.call(files.querySelectorAll('.file'));\n    var row = rows[2];\n    target = row;\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c){ openMenu(120, 70); return; }\n    if(c.el) c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.moveTo(row);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press(); row.classList.add('pressing');\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.release(); row.classList.remove('pressing');\n        var rr = row.getBoundingClientRect();\n        openMenu(rr.left + 26, rr.top + rr.height + 2);\n        var copyItem = menu.querySelector('[data-act=\"copy\"]');\n        later(function(){\n          c.moveTo(copyItem);\n          later(function(){\n            c.press(); copyItem.classList.add('sel');\n            later(function(){\n              c.release(); copyItem.classList.remove('sel');\n              act('copy');\n              if(typeof c.hide === 'function') c.hide();\n            }, 190);\n          }, 560);\n        }, 620);\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 4200); }, 300);\n  }\n\n  setStatus('3 个文件');\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
